  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pilotprojekt PPP and B4D skolmj&#xF6;lk i Zambia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia schoolmilk pilot PPP, B4D, WFP - Extension phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot project for school milk in Zambia - PPP with Tetra Pak, WFP, under Business for Development, B4D. The immediate goal is to develop and test a nationwide, feasible, affordable and cost-effective model for milk to schoolchildren. The model aims to improve the nutritional status of malnourished children in primary schools. The model can also increase income for small dairy farmers.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pilotprojekt f&#xF6;r skolmj&#xF6;lk i Zambia - PPP med Tetra Pak, WFP, under Business for Development, B4D. Omedelbara m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att utveckla och testa en rikst&#xE4;ckande, genomf&#xF6;rbar, prisv&#xE4;rd och kostnadseffektiv modell f&#xF6;r mj&#xF6;lk till skolbarn. Modellen syftar till att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra nutritionsstatus hos undern&#xE4;rda barn i grundskolan. Modellen kan dessutom &#xF6;ka inkomsterna f&#xF6;r sm&#xE5; mj&#xF6;lkb&#xF6;nder.</narrative>
  </description>
